    "overlap_area_spherical": {
      "params": [
        "ring_a",
        "cell_a",
        "nv_a",
        "ring_b",
        "cell_b",
        "nv_b"
      ],
      "description": "Overlap area in steradians (unit sphere) of two convex spherical polygons with great-circle edges: cell `cell_a` of the `[cells, nv_a, 3]` unit-vector stack `ring_a` and cell `cell_b` of `ring_b` (build a stack from lon-lat degrees with `lonlat_to_unit`). The value of `polygon_intersection_area` with `manifold: \"spherical\"` (or `\"geodesic\"`, the same great-circle model) within the CONFORMANCE_SPEC §5.8.2 tolerance; multiply by R^2 for a physical area. Either ring orientation (the interior is the side of less than a hemisphere); repeated vertices contribute exactly zero. Half-space tests are linear in the chord parameter; each clipped edge contributes the signed area of the spherical triangle it spans with the first vertex of `ring_a` (Van Oosterom-Strackee, `atan2`). A half-space test within 1e-14 of zero counts as on the great circle. Each polygon must lie within a hemisphere; non-convex input is outside the contract.",
      "body": {"op":"ifelse","args":[{"op":"or","args":[{"op":"==","args":[{"op":"faq","args":["ring_a","ring_b"],"output_idx":[],"reduce":"+","ranges":{"k_overlap_area_spherical_1":[1,"nv_a"]},"expr":{"op":"+","args":[{"op":"*","args":[{"op":"index","args":["ring_a","cell_a",1,1]},{"op":"-","args":[{"op":"*","args":[{"op":"index","args":["ring_a","cell_a","k_overlap_area_spherical_1",2]},{"op":"index","args":["ring_a","cell_a",{"op":"ifelse","args":[{"op":"<","args":["k_overlap_area_spherical_1","nv_a"]},{"op":"+","args":["k_overlap_area_spherical_1",1]},1]},3]}]},{"op":"*","args":[{"op":"index","args":["ring_a","cell_a","k_overlap_area_spherical_1",3]},{"op":"index","args":["ring_a","cell_a",{"op":"ifelse","args":[{"op":"<","args":["k_overlap_area_spherical_1","nv_a"]},{"op":"+","args":["k_overlap_area_spherical_1",1]},1]},2]}]}]}]},{"op":"*","args":[{"op":"index","args":["ring_a","cell_a",1,2]},{"op":"-","args":[{"op":"*","args":[{"op":"index","args":["ring_a","cell_a","k_overlap_area_spherical_1",3]},{"op":"index","args":["ring_a","cell_a",{"op":"ifelse","args":[{"op":"<","args":["k_overlap_area_spherical_1","nv_a"]},{"op":"+","args":["k_overlap_area_spherical_1",1]},1]},1]}]},{"op":"*","args":[{"op":"index","args":["ring_a","cell_a","k_overlap_area_spherical_1",1]},{"op":"index","args":["ring_a","cell_a",{"op":"ifelse","args":[{"op":"<","args":["k_overlap_area_spherical_1","nv_a"]},{"op":"+","args":["k_overlap_area_spherical_1",1]},1]},3]}]}]}]},{"op":"*","args":[{"op":"index","args":["ring_a","cell_a",1,3]},{"op":"-","args":[{"op":"*","args":[{"op":"index","args":["ring_a","cell_a","k_overlap_area_spherical_1",1]},{"op":"index","args":["ring_a","cell_a",{"op":"ifelse","args":[{"op":"<","args":["k_overlap_area_spherical_1","nv_a"]},{"op":"+","args":["k_overlap_area_spherical_1",1]},1]},2]}]},{"op":"*","args":[{"op":"index","args":["ring_a","cell_a","k_overlap_area_spherical_1",2]},{"op":"index","args":["ring_a","cell_a",{"op":"ifelse","args":[{"op":"<","args":[